Third-party components
----------------------

HydraDB
  Source: https://github.com/hydra-db/hydradb
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
  Role: separate Docker service (graph-node). Backstory talks to it over
  Bolt/HTTP and does not vendor HydraDB source.

LongMemEval
  Source: https://github.com/xiaowu0162/LongMemEval
  Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/xiaowu0162/longmemeval-cleaned
  License: see upstream repository / Hugging Face card (MIT for the cleaned set)
  Role: primary evaluation dataset. Evaluation script vendored under
  vendor/longmemeval for reproducibility.

BEAM
  Source: https://github.com/mohammadtavakoli78/BEAM
  License: MIT (code), CC BY-SA 4.0 (benchmark data)
  Role: architectural reference and optional stress tests. Not required to run
  the product.

neo4j Python driver
  License: Apache-2.0
  Role: optional Bolt client.

Other Python dependencies are listed in pyproject.toml with their respective
licenses.
